u a vstupní chodba s velkou skříní. \r\n\r\nLaminátová plovoucí podlaha, dlažba, elektrický kotel na vytápění, podlahové topení v koupelně, pračka, myčka, indukční varná deska s integrovanou digestoří, mikrovlnná trouba, TV.","detail_done":true,"disp":"3+kk","district":6,"first_seen":"2026-10-27","floor":2,"floors_total":null,"furnished":"yes","garage":null,"heating":null,"history":[["2026-10-27",34500]],"id":"sreality-989007948","images":["https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/nPQ64TBsMvCorp5D8DIIVpHH/d768.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/kPw320bnC5B3zcjDIzIIVpPG/da63.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/nPQ64TBsMvDvIuUD8KIIVpXB/5bc1.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/kPw320bnC5B3yt3C0RIIVpek/8682.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/nPQ64TBsMvDvIuUD8KIIVpni/d577.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/kPw320bnC5lmsPDQMIIVpvZ/d141.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/kPw320bnC5B3yt3C0RIIVp3a/1cd5.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/nPQ64TBsMvCAM2TDyoIIVqBU/9f76.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/nPQ64TBsMvNXddEirIIVqJU/d727.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/kPw320bnC5Dv66YDwBIIVqRf/ec17.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/nPQ64TBsMvCorp5C0wIIVqZX/72c8.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/kPw320bnC5CIwXsDfoIIVqhN/f608.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/kPw320bnC5C2PLRCtmIIVqpP/cb16.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/kPw320bnC5B3yt3C0dIIVqxD/81b0.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/kPw320bnC5C2PLRC26IIVq5O/d8d7.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/nPQ64TBsMv4DeCF5lIIVrDb/8401.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/kPw320bnC5Bj4lmBxYIIVrLE/48ab.jpeg?fl=res,1024,76